WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.740
Hello everybody! [Closed Captions provided by Captain Cool, and others as well! Now including a new face!]

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:03.160
My name is Markiplier and welcome to INSIDE.

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:06.020
