00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.020
But I just got so busy

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:11.840
And in fact,

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.840
I'm prepping for Comic-Con right now,

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.400
which means that I'm gonna go meet you guys-

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.400
If anyone's going to San Diego, say hi to me!

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.400
I'm gonna be at the Red Giant booth while I'm there.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.580
Um, but also,

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.400
I tried to start...

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.420
...recording this just a little bit ago,

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.580
and this is going to be really disgusting

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.960
and probably doesn't speak well to my

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:32.020
hygiene and how I take care of everything in my room--

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.800
--please don't judge me!

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:36.880
--There's something about the...

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.180
...the color scheme?

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.480
Oh, by the way, this is very nice--

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:42.120
there's so many nuanced animations in this game

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:44.360
that I absolutely love, but--

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:48.480
I'll get to the game in a second, I gotta talk about this horrifying thing!

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:50.040
The--

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:53.300
--color scheme made this glare appear on my monitor

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:53.800
and...

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.620
made me finally notice...

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:57.580
all the spit

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.520
